# GlassPro uses only public, unauthenticated exchange endpoints.
# No API keys are required for market data or liquidation feeds.
#
# This file exists because the build applies the Secrets Gradle Plugin; the
# key below is only consumed by optional Firebase services, which are not
# required for the core application. Leave it commented out for a build
# without Firebase wiring.
# FIREBASE_API_KEY=
